          "document_start": 251,
          "document_end": 292,
          "text": "常用二维单元有三角形或矩形板、壳，三维单元有四面体（三角锥）、五面体或平行六面体。",
          "section_id": "section_f18d486f24d7",
          "start": 251,
          "end": 292,
          "chunk_start": 251,
          "chunk_end": 292,
          "sentence_document_start": 251,
          "sentence_document_end": 292,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_690d8b803454c833ddb0",
          "document_start": 292,
          "document_end": 331,
          "text": "根据插值节点数目，单元又可分为线性单元（无中间节点）和二次单元（有中间节点）。",
          "section_id": "section_f18d486f24d7",
          "start": 292,
          "end": 331,
          "chunk_start": 292,
          "chunk_end": 331,
          "sentence_document_start": 292,
          "sentence_document_end": 331,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_900a03bf9c030cdf714c",
          "document_start": 331,
          "document_end": 360,
          "text": "对一般结构而言，线性单元可以花费很少，但却能达到一定精度；",
          "section_id": "section_f18d486f24d7",
          "start": 331,
          "end": 360,
          "chunk_start": 331,
          "chunk_end": 360,
          "sentence_document_start": 331,
          "sentence_document_end": 360,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_a5bcdc5a08e50f735b3b",
          "document_start": 360,
          "document_end": 388,
          "text": "对于非线性结构或退化单元形状，二次单元会产生更好的效果。",
          "section_id": "section_f18d486f24d7",
          "start": 360,
          "end": 388,
          "chunk_start": 360,
          "chunk_end": 388,
          "sentence_document_start": 360,
          "sentence_document_end": 388,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_7901bdd340d8e89d5aa0",
          "document_start": 388,
          "document_end": 487,
          "text": "由此可见，同一形状单元可有不同单元节点数（如图5-2所示），如六面体单元有8节点和20节点之分、三角形单元有3节点和6节点之分、四边形单元有4节点和8节点之分等，所以有限元可使用的单元种类十分丰富。",
          "section_id": "section_f18d486f24d7",
          "start": 388,
          "end": 487,
          "chunk_start": 388,
          "chunk_end": 487,
          "sentence_document_start": 388,
          "sentence_document_end": 487,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_feefa9c91128517f4920",
          "document_start": 487,
          "document_end": 537,
          "text": "在使用有限单元模拟真实物理结构时，要根据对象具体物理形状选择某种单元，也可以将不同类型单元混合使用。",
          "section_id": "section_f18d486f24d7",
          "start": 487,
          "end": 537,
          "chunk_start": 487,
          "chunk_end": 537,
          "sentence_document_start": 487,
          "sentence_document_end": 537,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_f7854e3312a92315e0cc",
          "document_start": 537,
          "document_end": 601,
          "text": "图5-2中列举了一些在二维、三维问题中常用的单元形式，选择何种单元类型涉及所求解问题类型、计算精度要求、计算经济性等多方面因素。",
          "section_id": "section_f18d486f24d7",
          "start": 537,
          "end": 601,
          "chunk_start": 537,
          "chunk_end": 601,
          "sentence_document_start": 537,
          "sentence_document_end": 601,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_445ea4ac1e7c2486f359",
          "document_start": 603,
          "document_end": 623,
          "text": "[Source paragraph 3;",
          "section_id": "section_f18d486f24d7",
          "start": 603,
          "end": 623,
          "chunk_start": 603,
          "chunk_end": 623,
          "sentence_document_start": 603,
          "sentence_document_end": 623,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_096636225f35d1fb8cce",
          "document_start": 624,
          "document_end": 628,
          "text": "# 1.",
          "section_id": "section_f18d486f24d7",
          "start": 624,
          "end": 628,
          "chunk_start": 624,
          "chunk_end": 628,
          "sentence_document_start": 624,
          "sentence_document_end": 628,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_d951b4b25bb8685aa845",
          "document_start": 629,
          "document_end": 641,
          "text": "定义有限元模型单元属性;",
          "section_id": "section_f18d486f24d7",
          "start": 629,
          "end": 641,
          "chunk_start": 629,
          "chunk_end": 641,
          "sentence_document_start": 629,
          "sentence_document_end": 641,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_487f1d3ba8c414c1d00d",
          "document_start": 642,
          "document_end": 674,
          "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
          "section_id": "section_f18d486f24d7",
          "start": 642,
          "end": 674,
          "chunk_start": 642,
          "chunk_end": 674,
          "sentence_document_start": 642,
          "sentence_document_end": 674,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_74bf35cbcc523368607c",
          "document_start": 676,
          "document_end": 686,
          "text": "（3）定义材料特性。",
          "section_id": "section_f18d486f24d7",
          "start": 676,
          "end": 686,
          "chunk_start": 676,
          "chunk_end": 686,
          "sentence_document_start": 676,
          "sentence_document_end": 686,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_7af7787dce8bbb069348",
          "document_start": 686,
          "document_end": 710,
          "text": "典型的材料特性包括弹性模量、密度、热膨胀系数等。",
          "section_id": "section_f18d486f24d7",
          "start": 686,
          "end": 710,
          "chunk_start": 686,
          "chunk_end": 710,
          "sentence_document_start": 686,
          "sentence_document_end": 710,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_711ed1f1a741a120dbb1",
          "document_start": 710,
          "document_end": 728,
          "text": "每种材料特性都可以表示为温度的函数。",
          "section_id": "section_f18d486f24d7",
          "start": 710,
          "end": 728,
          "chunk_start": 710,
          "chunk_end": 728,
          "sentence_document_start": 710,
          "sentence_document_end": 728,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_55e74435a3822389dade",
          "document_start": 728,
          "document_end": 784,
          "text": "无须迭代求解的材料称为线性材料，而需要迭代求解的材料称为非线性材料，线性材料和非线性材料需要使用不同方法来定义。",
          "section_id": "section_f18d486f24d7",
          "start": 728,
          "end": 784,
          "chunk_start": 728,
          "chunk_end": 784,
          "sentence_document_start": 728,
          "sentence_document_end": 784,
          "sentence_complete": true
        }
      ],
